sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant M as Master
    participant B as MQTT broker
    participant C as Client
    participant N as Nav2 + Gazebo

    Note over C,N: Robot is driving from n2 to n3
    M->>B: instantActions: startPause
    B->>C: instantActions: startPause
    C->>N: cancel goal (the order is kept)
    C->>B: state: startPause RUNNING, driving=true
    N-->>C: CANCELED (robot has stopped)
    C->>B: state: paused=true, driving=false, startPause FINISHED
    B->>M: state → "PAUSED"

    Note over C: Robot waits. lastNodeId stays n2.

    M->>B: instantActions: stopPause
    B->>C: instantActions: stopPause
    C->>N: NavigateToPose(n3), the same node as before
    C->>B: state: paused=false, driving=true, stopPause FINISHED
    B->>M: state → "RESUMED"
    N-->>C: SUCCEEDED
    C->>B: state: lastNodeId = n3
